source: crates/franken-node/tests/cli_subcommand_goldens.rs
---
Ed25519 capability tokens; `use` is dry-run (does not send HTTP)

Usage: franken-node remotecap <COMMAND>

Commands:
  issue   Issue a local Ed25519 capability token (does not perform the scoped network operation)
  verify  Verify a capability token without consuming single-use tokens
  use     Authorize a token (dry-run; does not send the HTTP request)
  revoke  Revoke a capability token in the local CLI state
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
